2. DC Storage Failure Scenario

Suppose:

DC1 Storage = DOWN
DC1 Containers = UP
DC2 Storage = UP
DC2 Containers = UP

Do not let the DC1 containers continuously fail trying to process files.

Instead:

DC1 File Workers
Storage Health Check
        ↓
      FAILED
        ↓
File Intake = PAUSED
        ↓
No new file processing

But the same DC1 pods should continue operating their other workloads:

DC1
├── File Intake       PAUSED
├── Payment Processing ACTIVE
├── Outbox Publisher  ACTIVE
├── BCBS Consumer     ACTIVE
├── BCBS Producer     ACTIVE
└── Settlement        ACTIVE

And DC2:

DC2
├── File Intake       ACTIVE
├── Payment Processing ACTIVE
├── Outbox Publisher  ACTIVE
├── BCBS Consumer     ACTIVE
├── BCBS Producer     ACTIVE
└── Settlement        ACTIVE

This is exactly the behavior you are looking for.

